---
import Icon from './Icon.astro';import {content} from '../lib/content/data';import {siteConfig} from '../config/site.config';
const email=siteConfig.contacts.email||content.site.contacts.email;
---
<dialog id="project-dialog" class="project-dialog" aria-label="Project details"><button class="dialog-close" data-close-project aria-label="Close project"><Icon name="close"/></button><div id="project-dialog-content"></div><div id="project-dialog-player-slot"></div></dialog>
<dialog id="contact-dialog" class="small-dialog" aria-labelledby="contact-title"><button class="dialog-close" data-close-dialog aria-label="Close contact form"><Icon name="close"/></button><p class="eyebrow">LET’S MAKE SOMETHING MEANINGFUL</p><h2 id="contact-title">Get in <em>touch.</em></h2><p>Tell me a little about your story.</p><p class="prototype-note">Local prototype: this form does not send messages.</p><form id="contact-form"><label>Your name<input name="name" autocomplete="name" required maxlength="120"/></label><label>Email address<input type="email" name="email" autocomplete="email" required maxlength="254"/></label><label>Your message<textarea name="message" rows="4" required minlength="10" maxlength="5000"></textarea></label><button type="submit" class="outline-button">Check message <Icon name="arrow"/></button><p class="form-status" role="status"></p></form>{email&&<a class="text-link" href={`mailto:${email}`}>Use your email app ↗</a>}</dialog>
<dialog id="consent-dialog" class="small-dialog" aria-labelledby="consent-title"><button class="dialog-close" data-close-dialog aria-label="Close media settings"><Icon name="close"/></button><p class="eyebrow">YOUR CHOICE</p><h2 id="consent-title">External <em>media.</em></h2><p>Films can be loaded from YouTube or Vimeo. These providers receive your IP address when a film is loaded. Local images and the website work without them.</p><p class="consent-status" role="status"></p><div class="consent-actions"><button class="outline-button" data-consent="accepted">Allow external media</button><button class="outline-button" data-consent="rejected">Reject / withdraw</button></div><a href="/privacy/">Read the privacy information ↗</a></dialog>
<div class="cookie-notice" aria-label="External media preference" hidden><p>External films are off.<br/><span>You choose what to load.</span></p><button data-consent="rejected">Keep off</button><button data-consent-settings>Media settings</button></div>
